 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Live · Cloudflare quick tunnel
  GitHub notifies Bonsai the moment a PR, push or check changes (GitHub's
  change notifications, also called webhooks).

  You need   cloudflared   ✓ installed (2026.9.3)
             admin rights on the repos you pick
  Setup      ●○○ one step, no account
  Delay      ~1 s
  Exposes    only Bonsai's change receiver; unsigned requests are rejected
  Note       The public address changes each time bonsai web starts. Bonsai
             re-points your GitHub notifications automatically.
  Status     available in a later version
